{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":968,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1906140,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285022,"Name":"Lilako10","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285022.jpg?_r=1445709424","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1444507832,"LastPoster":{"Id":285090,"Name":"MaryMofidi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285090.jpg?_r=1444867146","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":159,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":38,"Preview":{"Id":1906275,"PostDate":1444871779,"PostContent":"Beautiful Resort, my husband and I stayed there in March 2015. I would recommend contacting the w...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marjan_mofidi1968@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.238.124.104","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444870000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285090.jpg?_r=1444867146","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":159,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MaryMofidi","Id":285090,"Name":"MaryMofidi","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.64.62","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79643,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ce312f36fbb0d89ab0e14f51da72975","RawContent":"We are getting married at the riu santa fe this coming January and we have selected the caprice package with a semi private dinner and then we are considering have speeches, first dance, and reception in the disco bar. Is this a good idea? Any suggestions? We have been patiently awaiting information from the resort but have received nothing yet. If anyone has any information on weddings at the santa fe could you please send it to lindsey_alexay@hotmail.com.","Attachments":[],"Id":1906140,"PostDate":1444507832,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married at the riu santa fe this coming January and we have selected the caprice package with a semi private dinner and then we are considering have speeches, first dance, and reception in the disco bar. Is this a good idea? Any suggestions? We have been patiently awaiting information from the resort but have received nothing yet. If anyone has any information on weddings at the santa fe could you please send it to lindsey_alexay@hotmail.com.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lindsey_alexay@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.161.64.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444092625,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285022.jpg?_r=1445709424","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilako10","Id":285022,"Name":"Lilako10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79643,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45c71e0bb8a0e7c1d8da86a1cbd2d18a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! I&#039;ve seen pics of that property and we almost travelled there a few years ago, and it looks beautiful! Cabo is a great place!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you tried calling the resort at all? When you say you&#039;re waiting for info - you haven&#039;t received anything at all? Not your menus, or location confirmations or anything? Generally the WCs will get in touch a couple of months before your wedding but you definitely should at least have received confirmations of some of your details so that your pricing can be calculated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906176,"PostDate":1444710790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! I've seen pics of that property and we almost travelled there a few years ago, and it looks beautiful! Cabo is a great place!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you tried calling the resort at all? When you say you're waiting for info - you haven't received anything at all? Not your menus, or location confirmations or anything? Generally the WCs will get in touch a couple of months before your wedding but you definitely should at least have received confirmations of some of your details so that your pricing can be calculated.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.238.124.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79643,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9346d9d35389e389795e204f84fb2545","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Beautiful Resort, my husband and I stayed there in March 2015. I would recommend contacting the wedding department of the resort, as the general email can get lost at times or try calling in directly and ask to speak with a wedding coordinator.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We had witnessed a wedding on the resort when we had our week stay there and it looked like the couple had a beach front ceremony and their reception was located at one of the resort restaurants. Look into options for private reception compared to semi private areas. We noticed some of the guests were not happy about the fact that the entire resort had access to the wedding reception and dance area. Look at your options!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906275,"PostDate":1444871779,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Beautiful Resort, my husband and I stayed there in March 2015. I would recommend contacting the wedding department of the resort, as the general email can get lost at times or try calling in directly and ask to speak with a wedding coordinator.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We had witnessed a wedding on the resort when we had our week stay there and it looked like the couple had a beach front ceremony and their reception was located at one of the resort restaurants. Look into options for private reception compared to semi private areas. We noticed some of the guests were not happy about the fact that the entire resort had access to the wedding reception and dance area. Look at your options!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this helps! \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marjan_mofidi1968@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.238.124.104","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444870000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285090.jpg?_r=1444867146","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":159,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MaryMofidi","Id":285090,"Name":"MaryMofidi","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79643","Title":"Riu Santa Fe January 2016","LastPostDate":1444871779},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
