{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":17,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2254,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1149429,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":220052,"Name":"cammie","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220052.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1273814895,"LastPoster":{"Id":223381,"Name":"GVphotographer","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223381.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":38,"Preview":{"Id":1912014,"PostDate":1458266253,"PostContent":"Hi!! I would recommend everybody to have a Villa wedding, I don\u2019t like resorts full of people. I...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@artncolors.com","IpAddress":"189.176.187.29","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1258590501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223381.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GVphotographer","Id":223381,"Name":"GVphotographer","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13d610295ef344a800fdf89e4ec721ec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My FI and I have both agreed we want to have a private location for our wedding with our own vendors and such.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My question is: Did your\/Does your WC help you decide what locations are best or did you pick your wedding location on your own? I&#039;ve only been to Cabo once and think I will need help!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; J&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1236167,"PostDate":1280413354,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My FI and I have both agreed we want to have a private location for our wedding with our own vendors and such.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My question is: Did your\/Does your WC help you decide what locations are best or did you pick your wedding location on your own? I've only been to Cabo once and think I will need help!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> J<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jordangilbreath@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280411189,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230809.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":84,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JeggoMyEggo","Id":230809,"Name":"JeggoMyEggo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"742574ab8a92cc6ecc60d123b5689764","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My husband and I had been to Cabo before but never together. We decided on a private villa b\/c of the noise restrictions at all of the hotels. Who wants to stop dancing at 10 pm on your wedding night?!? Not us! At the villa we went until 3 am!&amp;nbsp; We narrowed our search really by villas without noise restrictions and beach access b\/c we wanted a ceremony on the beach.&amp;nbsp; I then had my WC do site visits and give me her opinion.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope that helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1243825,"PostDate":1280989559,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My husband and I had been to Cabo before but never together. We decided on a private villa b\/c of the noise restrictions at all of the hotels. Who wants to stop dancing at 10 pm on your wedding night?!? Not us! At the villa we went until 3 am!\u00a0 We narrowed our search really by villas without noise restrictions and beach access b\/c we wanted a ceremony on the beach.\u00a0 I then had my WC do site visits and give me her opinion.<\/p> <p> Hope that helps!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cammienguyen@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1249102616,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220052.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cammie","Id":220052,"Name":"cammie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab0c3652418b48bce62e9b9109e5213f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Cammie, do you have somewhere else the photos are posted?   The link has expired but your wedding sounds amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1261593,"PostDate":1282405478,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Cammie, do you have somewhere else the photos are posted?\u00a0\u00a0 The link has expired but your wedding sounds amazing.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"irene1182@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282068465,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231454.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Irene1182","Id":231454,"Name":"Irene1182","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc8df7038925ab9a31eb000dd58a249d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Cammie, thanks for your review.&amp;nbsp; So I&#039;m seriously considering the Blue Seas Villas...&amp;nbsp; Where did most of your guests stay?&amp;nbsp; Walking distance is Marbella and close to that is the Hilton...&amp;nbsp; Did you stay the entire wedding trip or just the minimum 2 nights?&amp;nbsp; Was it difficult for you to choose who would stay in the villa or did people decide themselves and did you subsidize at all?&amp;nbsp; Also, I&#039;d love to see pictures but it looks like your link expired.&amp;nbsp; My email address is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:anna.shahsovar@gmail.com\"&gt;anna.shahsovar@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt; if you could email me whatever (pics, answers, adivce, etc.), I&#039;d be so grateful!!!&amp;nbsp; Thanks cammie.&amp;nbsp; I hope to hear from you soon! :) Anna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1285916,"PostDate":1284444863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Cammie, thanks for your review.\u00a0 So I'm seriously considering the Blue Seas Villas...\u00a0 Where did most of your guests stay?\u00a0 Walking distance is Marbella and close to that is the Hilton...\u00a0 Did you stay the entire wedding trip or just the minimum 2 nights?\u00a0 Was it difficult for you to choose who would stay in the villa or did people decide themselves and did you subsidize at all?\u00a0 Also, I'd love to see pictures but it looks like your link expired.\u00a0 My email address is <a href='mailto:anna.shahsovar@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>anna.shahsovar@gmail.com<\/a> if you could email me whatever (pics, answers, adivce, etc.), I'd be so grateful!!!\u00a0 Thanks cammie.\u00a0 I hope to hear from you soon! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Anna<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anna_shahsovar@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1251942585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221262.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anna2912","Id":221262,"Name":"anna2912","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"003fb0090f5e568a64f2b2c081151cd0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We have booked Blue Sea Villas for our wedding in April 2011. We are having the ceremony on the beach and the reception at one of the houses (Ville Anne-Lie). If you have any tips on hosting the wedding at that spot, I would love to hear them.&amp;nbsp; THanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1307289,"PostDate":1286505383,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We have booked Blue Sea Villas for our wedding in April 2011. We are having the ceremony on the beach and the reception at one of the houses (Ville Anne-Lie). If you have any tips on hosting the wedding at that spot, I would love to hear them.\u00a0 THanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tini70@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1284057819,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232188.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tini70","Id":232188,"Name":"tini70","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e575f5903c4b35f6f0f37d49df735ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; tini70...I am a MOB and am such a newbie on this site.I have become addicted to reading all this great info. Ok, so you have already had your wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My daughter has not yet set the date. We love Cabo, and Pedregal Beach is where she really wants the ceremony and we are thinking of renting a villa for the guests. Here is our dilemma. Pedregal charges a fee for a beach wedding and also only allows 20 (or so we are told) on the beach for the ceremony. Oh...and they don&#039;t allow chairs.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We love staying close to town..and our concern is not being close to town for those who want to go out. Did you find that the villas on the Corridor were too far from Cabo San Lucas.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We have stayed at AI and condos in Cabo. Personally I love staying in condos close to town.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Did you see a problem staying at Blue Sea Villas? Also did it work with your budget?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I appreciate any input..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1457592,"PostDate":1306286384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> tini70...I am a MOB and am such a newbie on this site.I have become addicted to reading all this great info. Ok, so you have already had your wedding.<\/p> <p> My daughter has not yet set the date. We love Cabo, and Pedregal Beach is where she really wants the ceremony and we are thinking of renting a villa for the guests. Here is our dilemma. Pedregal charges a fee for a beach wedding and also only allows 20 (or so we are told) on the beach for the ceremony. Oh...and they don't allow chairs.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We love staying close to town..and our concern is not being close to town for those who want to go out. Did you find that the villas on the Corridor were too far from Cabo San Lucas.<\/p> <p> We have stayed at AI and condos in Cabo. Personally I love staying in condos close to town.<\/p> <p> Did you see a problem staying at Blue Sea Villas? Also did it work with your budget?<\/p> <p> I appreciate any input..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynparrott@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1306175927,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240314.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dallasrdh","Id":240314,"Name":"dallasrdh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.172.236.211","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab978c80fb2e2f1204d4d2fed582cef0","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Hi!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;I would recommend everybody to have a Villa wedding, I don\u2019t like resorts full of people. I get married 6 weeks ago and I rent a Villa at Puerto Los Cabos, everything turn out amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Here you can see a few weddings I shoot on private Villas:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/villa-las-rocas-los-cabos-wedding-christine-terry\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.gvphotogr...christine-terry&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/el-pedregal-los-cabos-wedding-jennifer-and-dan\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.gvphotogr...ennifer-and-dan&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/destination-wedding-in-cabo-san-lucas\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.gvphotogr...-cabo-san-lucas&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912014,"PostDate":1458266253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Hi!!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">I would recommend everybody to have a Villa wedding, I don\u2019t like resorts full of people. I get married 6 weeks ago and I rent a Villa at Puerto Los Cabos, everything turn out amazing.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Here you can see a few weddings I shoot on private Villas:<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/villa-las-rocas-los-cabos-wedding-christine-terry' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.gvphotogr...christine-terry<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/el-pedregal-los-cabos-wedding-jennifer-and-dan' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.gvphotogr...ennifer-and-dan<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/destination-wedding-in-cabo-san-lucas' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.gvphotogr...-cabo-san-lucas<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Happy planning!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@artncolors.com","IpAddress":"189.176.187.29","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1258590501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223381.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GVphotographer","Id":223381,"Name":"GVphotographer","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"51902","Title":"Cabo Wedding April 2010 - Vendor Reviews","LastPostDate":1458266253},"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
