  <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>Playa Grande is a nice location for a wedding and its so close to down town that you can go walking to the Marina and bars. I want to share with you a recent wedding I had there:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/playa-grande-wedding-jason-alex' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/playa-grande-wedding-jason-alex<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@artncolors.com","IpAddress":"189.176.187.29","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1258590501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223381.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GVphotographer","Id":223381,"Name":"GVphotographer","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"33812","Title":"Playa Grande Brides","LastPostDate":1456605742},"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
