y tips or infos about Cabo, I&#039;ve been living there and working in the wedding business for 6 years...\n Congratulations!","Attachments":[],"Id":646852,"PostDate":1239226733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Kristina!<br \/> Playa Grande is a very nice location for a wedding!<br \/> The beach there is beautiful and very \"grande\" of course!<br \/> I have shot a few weddings there, it is a very photogenis spot.<br \/> Good luck with your planning, and let me know if you nee any tips or infos about Cabo, I've been living there and working in the wedding business for 6 years...<br \/> Congratulations!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeremyhermanphoto@live.fr","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236728760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215668.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jeremy Herman PhotoVideo","Id":215668,"Name":"Jeremy Herman PhotoVideo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33812,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"227c8cdcc38d65558675a4a72224aa3f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacin