             }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>dmarie17<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">And last but not least, this never worn dress. I was going to do a TTD but was too tired! I'd like to sell it so if anyone likes it and wants to make me an offer, I'll get rid of it cheap!! I think that it's a size 8 (I'm a size 4 normally if that helps)<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i105.photobucket.com\/albums\/m211\/dmarie17\/Unknown-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Congrats Newlywed!<br \/> <br \/> I am considering wearing another dress for our TTD photo shoot. Cost and fit depending.<br \/> <br \/> How much are you willing to part with the dress for? <br \/> <br \/> Approximate shipping cost to Niagara Falls, Ontario, Canada?<br \/> <br \/> Thanks<br \/> Laura\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laura.lynn.hale@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1213228181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/c\/cb\/cb051bff_user-6060-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HaleGrifa","Id":209898,"Name":"HaleGrifa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"Topi