ly use wedding items-i work at a christian organization and dont make much money if anyone has items they cant use please contact me at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:hot411_2000@yahoo.com\"&gt;hot411_2000@yahoo.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1622130,"PostDate":1337535945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i am getting married july 14, 2012 and could really use wedding items-i work at a christian organization and dont make much money if anyone has items they cant use please contact me at <a href='mailto:hot411_2000@yahoo.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>hot411_2000@yahoo.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hot411_2000@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1337535800,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255590.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"broke tina","Id":255590,"Name":"broke tina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24375,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6583c7c3928ea33b431715e72a7c1387","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i am getting married july 14, 2012 and could really use wedding items-i work at a christian organization and do